#
# Podcast Index API key of Sailcast (podcast search). Copy this file to
# "podcastindex.pri" next to it and fill in the key and secret from
# https://api.podcastindex.org (free sign-up). podcastindex.pri is private:
# do not publish it (keep it out of the repository). Without it Sailcast
# builds and runs, only the search says that no key is built in.
#
# The secret is written HEX-ENCODED: it contains characters such as # and $
# that qmake (# = comment), make and the shell would change. Get the hex
# value with (fish or bash, single quotes):
#     printf '%s' 'YOUR-SECRET' | xxd -p -c 256
# The key has only letters and digits and is written as it is.
#
# After creating or changing this file: Clean, qmake, Build (the compiler
# flags change, an incremental build would keep the old object file).
DEFINES += PODCASTINDEX_KEY=\\\"YOUR-KEY\\\"
DEFINES += PODCASTINDEX_SECRET_HEX=\\\"YOUR-SECRET-IN-HEX\\\"
